37112>>>>>>
37112>>>>>        
37112>>>>>        Send Request_Save of hoUserDD
37113>>>>>        Function_Return (not(Err))
37114>>>>>    End_Function
37115>>>>>    
37115>>>>>    Function IsLoggedIn Returns Boolean
37117>>>>>        String sLoginName
37117>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession bLoggedIn
37117>>>>>        
37117>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37118>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37120>>>>>            Forward Get IsLoggedIn to bLoggedIn
37122>>>>>            Function_Return bLoggedIn
37123>>>>>        End
37123>>>>>>
37123>>>>>        
37123>>>>>        Get psLoginName to sLoginName
37124>>>>>        
37124>>>>>        Function_Return (sLoginName <> "")
37125>>>>>    End_Function
37126>>>>>    
37126>>>>>    
37126>>>>>    //
37126>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37126>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37126>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37126>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37126>>>>>    //
37126>>>>>    // Params:
37126>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37126>>>>>    //
37126>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37128>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37128>>>>>        
37128>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37129>>>>>        
37129>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37129>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37131>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37132>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37133>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37134>>>>>            
37134>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37135>>>>>        End
37135>>>>>>
37135>>>>>        Else Begin
37136>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37137>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37138>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37139>>>>>            
37139>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37140>>>>>        End
37140>>>>>>
37140>>>>>    End_Procedure
37141>>>>>    
37141>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37143>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37143>>>>>    End_Procedure
37144>>>>>    
37144>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37146>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37146>>>>>    End_Procedure
37147>>>>>    
37147>>>>>    Procedure EndSession
37149>>>>>        Integer iErr
37149>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession
37149>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
37149>>>>>        
37149>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37150>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37151>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37153>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37155>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37156>>>>>        End
37156>>>>>>
37156>>>>>            
37156>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37156>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37157>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37158>>>>>        
37158>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37159>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37161>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37162>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37163>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37165>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37165>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37166>>>>>>
37166>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37167>>>>>            End
37167>>>>>>
37167>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37168>>>>>        End
37168>>>>>>
37168>>>>>    End_Procedure
37169>>>>>
37169>>>>>End_Class
37170>>>>>
